# Kirakira project constraints

Interactive 3D Gundam effects viewer. Full agent workflow: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

## Non-negotiable (not ponytail-deletable)

- Catalog data only in `packages/catalog/effects.json`
- Shared DTOs only in `@kirakira/contracts`; runtime contract in `@kirakira/effect-sdk`
- No duplicate `Effect` / `ApiResponse` types in apps
- Zustand stores only (`useUIStore`, `useEffectStore`) — no React Context for global state
- Effect modules: `init` / `update` / `dispose` on `@kirakira/effect-sdk` contract
- Three.js effects attach under R3F `effectHost` group; dispose via `detachAndDispose` in `particleUtils.ts`
- Trust-boundary sanitizers (`shareUrl`, `presetValidation`, `paramSanitizer`, API CORS whitelist)
- `npm run verify` must pass before done; keep tests that CI relies on

## Ponytail-friendly defaults here

- Prefer extending existing helpers (`particleUtils`, `effectLifecycle`) over new files
- One effect file per catalog id under `apps/web/src/effects/examples/`
- No new npm deps for UI widgets the platform already has (`<input type="color">`, native range, etc.)
- Don't add layers between catalog JSON and `EffectModule` unless requested

## Session harness

Read `claude-progress.md` first; one `in_progress` item in `feature_list.json`; update evidence when shipping.
